<div class="content">
    <h1>Organization Unblocked!</h1>

    <p>Hello {{ownerName}},</p>

    <p>
        Great news! <strong>{{organizationName}}</strong> has been unblocked and your full access has been restored
        on the Orgatick platform.
    </p>

    <!-- Success Notice -->
    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%"
        style="margin: 25px 0; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #059669 100%); border-radius: 8px; padding: 24px 20px;">
        <tr>
            <td align="center">
                <img width="64" height="64"
                    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/niyojan-org/email-assets/icons/lineal/unlock.png" alt="unblocked"
                    class="dark-mode-safe"
                    style="-ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; color: transparent; display: block; margin: 0 auto 16px;" />
                <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 8px 0;">
                    Access Restored
                </h3>
                <p style="color: #ffffff; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; margin: 0;">
                    Your organization is now fully operational
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <p>
        Thank you for working with us to resolve the concerns that led to the temporary block. We appreciate your
        cooperation and commitment to maintaining platform standards.
    </p>

    <!-- What's Restored -->
    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%"
        style="margin: 25px 0; background-color: #f0f7ff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px;">
        <tr>
            <td>
                <h3 style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; color: #1f2937; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: center;">
                    ✨ Restored Access
                </h3>
                <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%"
                    style="max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto;">
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 10px 0; text-align: center;">
                            <img width="24" height="24"
                                src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/niyojan-org/email-assets/icons/lineal/visibility.png"
                                alt="visible" class="dark-mode-safe"
                                style="-ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; color: transparent; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" />
                            <span
                                style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: #1f2937; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: middle;">Organization
                                profile is public again</span>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 10px 0; text-align: center;">
                            <img width="24" height="24"
                                src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/niyojan-org/email-assets/icons/lineal/event-live.png"
                                alt="events" class="dark-mode-safe"
                                style="-ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; color: transparent; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" />
                            <span
                                style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: #1f2937; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: middle;">Events
                                are visible and searchable</span>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 10px 0; text-align: center;">
                            <img width="24" height="24"
                                src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/niyojan-org/email-assets/icons/lineal/sales.png"
                                alt="sales" class="dark-mode-safe"
                                style="-ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; color: transparent; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" />
                            <span
                                style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: #1f2937; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: middle;">Ticket
                                sales have resumed</span>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 10px 0; text-align: center;">
                            <img width="24" height="24"
                                src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/niyojan-org/email-assets/icons/lineal/edit.png"
                                alt="manage" class="dark-mode-safe"
                                style="-ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; color: transparent; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" />
                            <span
                                style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: #1f2937; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: middle;">Full
                                management capabilities restored</span>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    {{> button
    url=dashboardUrl
    label="Go to Dashboard"
    variant="primary"
    fullWidth=true
    marginTop="20px"
    marginBottom="20px"
    }}

    <!-- Moving Forward -->
    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%"
        style="margin: 25px 0; border-left: 4px solid #004aad; padding-left: 16px;">
        <tr>
            <td>
                <h3 style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; color: #1f2937; margin: 0 0 12px 0;">
                    Moving Forward:
                </h3>
                <ul style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;">
                    <li>Continue following our community guidelines and terms of service</li>
                    <li>Maintain accurate and honest event information</li>
                    <li>Respond promptly to any platform communications</li>
                    <li>Ensure a safe and positive experience for all attendees</li>
                </ul>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%"
        style="margin: 20px 0; background-color: #ecfdf5; border-left: 4px solid #10b981; padding: 16px;">
        <tr>
            <td>
                <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #065f46; margin: 0 0 8px 0;">
                    <strong>Partnership Matters:</strong>
                </p>
                <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #065f46; margin: 0;">
                    We value your partnership and are committed to helping you succeed. If you have any questions or
                    need support, our team is always here to help.
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%" style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <tr>
            <td align="">
                <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: #4b5563; margin: 0;">
                    Welcome back! We're glad to have you operating on the platform again.
                </p>
                <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: #4b5563; margin: 10px 0 0 0;">
                    Best regards,<br />
                    <strong style="color: #1f2937;">- Orgatick Team</strong>
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</div>
